  stepId: Step_03_StaticIPConfig
  instructionText: 'LO2.2 - A server must never lease its own address from DHCP.


    Start
    > Network Connections. Open Ethernet, then Properties. Select Internet Protocol
    Version 4 (TCP/IPv4) and press Properties again.


    Choose ''Use the following
    IP address'' and ''Use the following DNS server addresses then enter the static
    configuration and Prefered DNS server.'
